     fhir:Extension.valueMarkdown [ fhir:value "A PH Core Client initiates FHIR API requests to access or exchange PH Core resources. It correctly handles resources received in responses. When it produces resources for a supported write interaction, it fulfills the applicable population obligations. A read-only client is not required to author resource payloads. The role applies to the request being initiated; a system may also act as a PH Core Server in other exchanges. The API requirements are defined in the [PH Core Client CapabilityStatement](CapabilityStatement-PHCoreClientCapabilityStatement.html)." ]
